{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨晩ホラー映画観てたのよ...  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖いのわかってるし\nお風呂入れなくのわかってるし\nトイレ行けなくなるのもわかってるくせに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指の隙間から見ちゃうそんな私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外とビビりちゃん (๑╹∀╹๑)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえい❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわいな...でも見ちゃう..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あのねぇ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日飛鳥とMARISいってきたの(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっも行きたかったからサッパリした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛もちょっと今までよりも明るめのグリーンアッシュっぽい色♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言いつつみんなキリンのゴムに一番目がいくと思う。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョンマゲー  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は...楽しみな事があーるんだー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでしょーか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答えまーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、缶バッチでぁみあみが\nどこを担当したか教えてもらえますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、「み」だったはず...♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてで握手だけで流されしまったので名古屋、バイク飛ばして向かう予定です。\nあみあみ族に自分も入れますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、あみあみ族だよ(#^.^#)\n名古屋で待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１番好きなディズニー映画は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンデレラ❤❤❤\nあみはカボチャの馬車じゃなくて、\nメロンの馬車がいい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンボンバーの曲でこの曲は\n盛り上がれるっていうのある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女々しくて女々しくて女々しくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックバンだと誰好き？？\nテソンだといぃなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、TOPかな！！(＾ｰ^)ノ\nテソンも好きよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみと握手してませんが僕のこと覚えてますか？\n東京よみうりランドの握手会で頭ぶつけてたつばさです(>_<)\nせいらりんに聞いたら分かると思う(。>д<)\nよかったら答えてほしいです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えてるってー！！\nあれから握手会来てくれてないじゃん ╭(๑¯⌓¯๑)╮ 待ってるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タップダンスは習ってたの？\nタップダンスにはまるきっかけとかおしえて？\n好きなタップダンサーは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー正直習い始めた動機とかよく覚えてないんだ。笑\n小学生の時でダンス好きだったからくらいだった気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなタップダンサーは...わからない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺ね、Coffee飲んでも目が覚めないんだよ。何かいい方法ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回大きな声で、「ハッ！！」って言ってみたら気合入ると思うんだ。どうかね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BEASTレディース！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぅ...こわそうですねえ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島最強じゃ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/04/2640190/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}